Preserve existing fields such as amount, totalAmount, payMethod, chargeApplied, chargeAmount, chargeRate, sourceDeducted, isOpening, personId, and timestamps until the current code has been traced and compatibility tests pass.
New or extended documents
Payment methods
users/{uid}/paymentMethods/{methodId}
{
  name: "EBL",
  type: "bank", // cash | mobile_money | bank | credit_card | other
  isBuiltIn: false,
  isActive: true,
  createdAt: Timestamp,
  updatedAt: Timestamp,
  legacyNames: []
}
Built-in IDs should be stable and reserved. A method's display name is not its identity.
Migration history
users/{uid}/migrationJobs/{migrationId}
{
  format: "eco-backup",
  formatVersion: 1,
  sourceExportedAt: "...",
  status: "validating", // validating | importing | verifying | completed | partial | failed | rolled_back
  startedAt: Timestamp,
