19. Recommended User Journeys
Daily spending (fast path)
Dashboard/List/any page → + Add → Expense → Daily Expense → date/type → payment method/amount/description → Save → success → updated budget and List.
Monthly income
Any page → + Add → Earning → date/source (create source inline if needed) → receiving wallet/amount/description → Save → updated wallet and earnings statistics.
Moving money
Any page → + Add → Transfer → date → From/To/amount/note → review fee preview → Transfer Now → wallet balances update, spending/income totals remain correct.
Lending or borrowing from a local person
Any page → + Add → Transaction → date/person/tag (create inline if needed) → Give/Take/payment method/amount → Save → person's ledger and balance summaries update.
Recording with a connected EcO user
Choose connected person → create proposal → pending state and notification → recipient reviews → accept/reject → trusted canonical event updates both perspectives exactly once.
Importing old data
First launch → existing user → choose JSON → preview/validate → sign in → confirm → progress → verification report → Dashboard with imported history.
Reviewing behaviour
Dashboard → notice a neutral spending insight → Statistics for detail → List filtered to the relevant period/category → make a practical budget adjustment in Settings if desired. The app should suggest reflection, not make diagnoses or shame the user.
